OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 due to tunnel  
OL,4,Adefect                                 
OL,6,FMotorists faced long queues on the M25 
OL,7,Fas one of the tunnels at the Dartford  
OL,8,FCrossing was closed earlier due to a   
OL,9,Fdefect being found.                    
OL,11,FNational Highways said it was          
OL,12,Fdiscovered during overnight works,     
OL,13,Fmeaning it could not reopen at 05:00   
OL,14,FGMT on Monday as was scheduled.        
OL,16,FShortly after 14:30, National Highways 
OL,17,Fsaid repairs had been completed and the
OL,18,Feast bore of the tunnel had reopened,  
OL,19,Fbut delays remained.                   
