OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 due to tunnel  
OL,4,Adefect                                 
OL,6,FThere were also seven miles (11.3km) of
OL,7,Fcongestion on the approach, with       
OL,8,Ftraffic going back to junction 4 for   
OL,9,FOrpington on the anticlockwise         
OL,10,Fcarriageway.                           
